window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>PRISONER OR GUEST</b><br> <br> Hosted by the mysterious Ordo Occultatum, Paxton Locke stands accused of high crimes and will be judged on his skill at magic. Proving his worth in a morally twisted school for wizards was the last thing Paxton expected, but his fate hangs in the balance. Prove his worth, and the Ordo could be a powerful ally in the wars to come. Fail and die.<br> <br> Meanwhile, Valentine and the other agents of Division M face the escalating threat of the Void. The inter-dimensional monsters are prepared for a full-scale invasion. Staring down the possibility of public exposure—all while lacking their most capable operative—DC must provide Division M with the resources to prevent a cataclysm that threatens not only our world but multiple realities.</p>"; 
